WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
The proposed environment runs
the real payment application

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:06.600
and database against
a controlled provider model.

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:11.040
The test runner supplies reviewed
cases and isolated fixtures.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.720
A lifecycle owner handles
readiness, reset and cleanup.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:19.200
Results and run identifiers survive
outside the disposable environment,

00:00:19.253 --> 00:00:21.680
so removing resources does
not remove the failure.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:24.640
Provider and settlement
checks remain separate.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.680
The diagram's arrows
show the design's calls

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:31.360
and evidence handoffs,
rather than live system activity.
